# A STEP file linked as a solid (roadmap D3): a block with a hole links
# as a reference mesh; "read as solid" on its group screen reads its
# faces exact, the screen saying so; Analyze > Check Solid finds the
# solid sound; undo reads it as a mesh again. A file whose shape can't
# be read as a solid stays a mesh, the screen saying why.
file $testdata/step/host.tlspr
menu File|Open...
file $testdata/step/shapes/box_hole.step
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
tw
twmove 289 165
twdown L 289 165
twup L 289 165
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
key z ctrl
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
file $testdata/step/corpus/ap203e2_csg.stp
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
twmove 289 165
twdown L 289 165
twup L 289 165
tw
